      "text": "GUIDED RESPONSE\n\n1. Detect the performance signal\n\n2. Review database insight\n\n3. Correlate application impact\n\n4. Validate remediation",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "GUIDED RESPONSE\n\n1. Detect the performance signal\n\n2. Review database insight\n\n3. Correlate application impact\n\n4. Validate remediation",
      "autoResize": true,
